              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw ijuru rikwiye kumwākīra, gushitsa ku bihe vyo gusubira guhindura ibintu vyose bisha, nk’ukw Imana yavuze mu kanwa k’abera bayo yavugisha bose, uhereye ubga mbere na mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
